                <head>A No. 3.</head>
                <p><hi rendition="#italic">To Commodore Craven, aboard war-frigate Niagara,
                        Corunna:</hi></p>
                <p>I have your letter. Thanks. My impression is clear that you had better not.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>PERRY.</signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
